INFRASTRUCTURE CONSTRAINTS

This is a static evidence package. It has no hardware or network dependencies.

Requirements to evaluate this artifact:
  - An ordinary Linux or macOS environment.
  - Bash.
  - Python 3 (standard library only; no third-party packages required).
  - A SHA-256 utility (sha256sum on Linux, shasum -a 256 on macOS).

Expected total runtime for install.sh plus all claims/*/run.sh scripts: under one minute.

No compiler, no .NET runtime, no decompiler, no database, and no GPU are required to
evaluate this package. (A .NET runtime and ilspycmd were used to originally produce the
reverse-engineering observation in artifact/reverse-engineering/ — that step is not part of
this package and is not required to evaluate it; see infrastructure/evidence-boundary.txt.)
